#lang scribble/manual
@(require "defns.rkt")

@title[#:style '(unnumbered)]{Slides}

@(define slides-url
  (string-append "cmsc430-" year "-" semester ".pdf"))

Slides are updated after every class:
@link[(string-append "slides/" slides-url)]{@slides-url}

For individual PDF files for each lecture, see the @secref{Schedule}
and click on a date.